@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+---
+id: dl-002-round-long-rental-discounted-totals-down-to-whole-cents
+type: decision-log
+title: "Round long-rental discounted totals down to whole cents"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Context
+
+Rentals lasting three calendar days or more receive a 10% reduction. Prices are stored and returned
+as whole euro cents, but 90% of a whole-cent full price can contain a tenth of a cent.
+
+## Decision
+
+Calculate the full price first, then, for a rental of at least three days, calculate its total as
+`floor(full price * 90 / 100)` euro cents. Shorter rentals retain their full price.
+
+## Consequences
+
+The returned total always remains an integer number of cents and customers never receive less than
+the stated 10% reduction; when a tenth of a cent cannot be represented, the customer receives the
+extra fractional saving. Quotes and bookings use the same shared pricing calculation.
