@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@
+---
+id: task-003-apply-10-discount-to-rentals-of-three-or-more-days
+type: task
+title: "Apply 10% discount to rentals of three or more days"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Work completed
+
+Updated the shared pricing calculation so rentals of three days or more receive 10% off the full
+price in both quotes and bookings. One- and two-day rentals retain full pricing. Discounted totals
+round down to whole euro cents according to the
+[approved rounding decision](../decision-log/dl-002-round-long-rental-discounted-totals-down-to-whole-cents.md).
+Integer arithmetic preserves precision for large prices, and the existing full-price safe-integer
+validation remains in place.
+
+Updated README pricing guidance and examples, bumped its version, and documented the public pricing
+behavior.
+
+## Verification
+
+Classified the discount threshold, fractional-cent rounding, and large-price discounted totals as
+new behavior requiring red-first tests. Before implementation, six tests failed with full-price
+totals, including the new threshold and precision cases. After implementation, `npm test` passes
+all 15 tests and TypeScript compilation. Tests exercise one through five days in both quotes and
+bookings, boards and sails, zero prices, cent rounding, safe-integer precision, and existing error
+and booking behavior. Existing validation and reservation checks provide characterization coverage.
+`git diff --check` passes.
